Subject: [PATCH 17/19] Lapin UX: taskbar clock seconds switch under Date &
 time too

The same dev.lapinux.Shell clock_seconds switch as Taskbar behaviors,
in Time & language > Date & time > Time format, only in Lapin UX (#38).
Also found by Settings search.
